<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>You’ve called us into fellowship</l><l>Of Your dear Son, our Lord,</l><l>That He may be our portion full,</l><l>Our center, our accord.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Though we unfaithful oft will be,</l><l>Yet You are faithful still,</l><l>Though not for human welfare but</l><l>For Your eternal will.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Since we’ve believed into Your Son</l><l>Some losses You’ve allowed</l><l>That we from broken cisterns turn</l><l>To drink our Fountain-God.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Your faithfulness has led us in</l><l>To Your economy,</l><l>Where Christ we all enjoy that You</l><l>In us may increased be.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>The living water’s faithful flow</l><l>We drink and shout, Amen;</l><l>The destination of this flow</l><l>The New Jerusalem.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
